{"prefectureId":"17","cities":{"17201":[{"id":"17201:national:9ce61b560ce7","cityId":"17201","category":"文化・名所","text":"市内には、犀川と浅野川の二つの川が流れています。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E9%87%91%E6%B2%A2%E5%B8%82&oldid=111380223"},{"id":"17201:national:d18fcf7da031","cityId":"17201","category":"文化・名所","text":"金沢市の海に面した地域に大野地区は醤油の産地で、今でも醤油蔵が立ち並んでいます。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E9%87%91%E6%B2%A2%E5%B8%82&oldid=111380223"},{"id":"17201:national:2ebe87bb0298","cityId":"17201","category":"歴史","text":"金沢市消防本部（現：金沢市消防局）が設置される。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E9%87%91%E6%B2%A2%E5%B8%82&oldid=111380223"},{"id":"17201:national:6ba000933b2a","cityId":"17201","category":"歴史","text":"金沢市はバスケットボールの会場として使用される。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E9%87%91%E6%B2%A2%E5%B8%82&oldid=111380223"}],"17202":[{"id":"17202:national:b98c124ce195","cityId":"17202","category":"地域","text":"七尾市は、石川県能登半島中央部にある市です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E4%B8%83%E5%B0%BE%E5%B8%82&oldid=111328750"}],"17203":[{"id":"17203:national:110f937651af","cityId":"17203","category":"地域","text":"小松市は、石川県南部にあり、日本海に面する市です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%B0%8F%E6%9D%BE%E5%B8%82&oldid=111307344"}],"17204":[{"id":"17204:national:95ce18726558","cityId":"17204","category":"地理・自然","text":"市域は面積426.32 km、東西約42 km、南北約31 kmに及ぶ広さです。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E8%BC%AA%E5%B3%B6%E5%B8%82&oldid=111065439"},{"id":"17204:national:5c443bfd5930","cityId":"17204","category":"地域","text":"輪島市は、石川県の北西部に位置する市です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E8%BC%AA%E5%B3%B6%E5%B8%82&oldid=111065439"}],"17205":[{"id":"17205:national:59224b774deb","cityId":"17205","category":"地理・自然","text":"珠洲市には宝立山があります。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E7%8F%A0%E6%B4%B2%E5%B8%82&oldid=111299278"},{"id":"17205:national:7509c717778a","cityId":"17205","category":"地理・自然","text":"珠洲市には猫ヶ岳があります。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E7%8F%A0%E6%B4%B2%E5%B8%82&oldid=111299278"},{"id":"17205:national:1045c96fee78","cityId":"17205","category":"地域","text":"珠洲市は、石川県北東部、能登半島（能登地方）の先端に位置する市です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E7%8F%A0%E6%B4%B2%E5%B8%82&oldid=111299278"}],"17206":[{"id":"17206:national:659f2e616c31","cityId":"17206","category":"地域","text":"加賀市は、石川県南西部（旧加賀国）にある市です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%8A%A0%E8%B3%80%E5%B8%82&oldid=111164827"}],"17207":[{"id":"17207:national:7e30d84b4ce0","cityId":"17207","category":"地域","text":"羽咋市は、石川県の能登地方にある市です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E7%BE%BD%E5%92%8B%E5%B8%82&oldid=111061650"}],"17209":[{"id":"17209:national:2adfaadd47ad","cityId":"17209","category":"地理・自然","text":"かほく市には宇ノ気川が流れています。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E3%81%8B%E3%81%BB%E3%81%8F%E5%B8%82&oldid=111400391"},{"id":"17209:national:292f78d809fe","cityId":"17209","category":"地理・自然","text":"かほく市には大海川が流れています。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E3%81%8B%E3%81%BB%E3%81%8F%E5%B8%82&oldid=111400391"},{"id":"17209:national:0fb8eff74f35","cityId":"17209","category":"地域","text":"かほく市は、石川県中部にある市です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E3%81%8B%E3%81%BB%E3%81%8F%E5%B8%82&oldid=111400391"}],"17210":[{"id":"17210:national:4028bff6adf7","cityId":"17210","category":"文化・名所","text":"「太田の大トチノキ」は国指定の天然記念物です。","source":"https://kunishitei.bunka.go.jp/heritage/detail/401/1020"},{"id":"17210:national:fb1c13516890","cityId":"17210","category":"文化・名所","text":"「御仏供スギ」は国指定の天然記念物です。","source":"https://kunishitei.bunka.go.jp/heritage/detail/401/994"},{"id":"17210:national:1612fa73981c","cityId":"17210","category":"地域","text":"白山市は、石川県の南部に位置する市です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E7%99%BD%E5%B1%B1%E5%B8%82&oldid=110783329"}],"17211":[{"id":"17211:national:a42ee10a63ba","cityId":"17211","category":"地理・自然","text":"市の西部は日本海に面し、北部には手取川が流れる。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E8%83%BD%E7%BE%8E%E5%B8%82&oldid=111085468"},{"id":"17211:national:484d61a1f07e","cityId":"17211","category":"地域","text":"能美市は、石川県の南部、加賀地方に位置する市です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E8%83%BD%E7%BE%8E%E5%B8%82&oldid=111085468"}],"17212":[{"id":"17212:national:9cbca871a183","cityId":"17212","category":"地域","text":"野々市市は、石川県の中部に位置する市です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E9%87%8E%E3%80%85%E5%B8%82%E5%B8%82&oldid=110685043"}],"17324":[{"id":"17324:national:7ae1a2de0f6f","cityId":"17324","category":"地域","text":"川北町は、石川県の南西に位置し、能美郡に所属する町です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%B7%9D%E5%8C%97%E7%94%BA&oldid=108586448"}],"17361":[{"id":"17361:national:56e00fb5f8e4","cityId":"17361","category":"地域","text":"津幡町は、石川県河北郡に属する町です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E6%B4%A5%E5%B9%A1%E7%94%BA&oldid=111206637"}],"17365":[{"id":"17365:national:1bcdc56d7de6","cityId":"17365","category":"地理・自然","text":"内灘町は河北潟放水路を境に、南部地域と北部地域に区分される。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%86%85%E7%81%98%E7%94%BA&oldid=108654967"},{"id":"17365:national:8b558afbccba","cityId":"17365","category":"地理・自然","text":"町域のほとんどが内灘砂丘です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%86%85%E7%81%98%E7%94%BA&oldid=108654967"},{"id":"17365:national:028c44501cbe","cityId":"17365","category":"歴史","text":"内灘町では震度5弱を観測した。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%86%85%E7%81%98%E7%94%BA&oldid=108654967"},{"id":"17365:national:009db66f9ce3","cityId":"17365","category":"地域","text":"内灘町は、石川県の中西部に位置する町です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%86%85%E7%81%98%E7%94%BA&oldid=108654967"}],"17384":[{"id":"17384:national:9c6b5694f44f","cityId":"17384","category":"地域","text":"志賀町は、石川県羽咋郡に属する町です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%BF%97%E8%B3%80%E7%94%BA&oldid=110546790"}],"17386":[{"id":"17386:national:ac3d6b1d4634","cityId":"17386","category":"地理・自然","text":"町域は日本海側から富山県との県境まで広がっています。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%AE%9D%E9%81%94%E5%BF%97%E6%B0%B4%E7%94%BA&oldid=111188464"},{"id":"17386:national:eb780e8976cf","cityId":"17386","category":"地理・自然","text":"宝達志水町には碁石が峰があります。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%AE%9D%E9%81%94%E5%BF%97%E6%B0%B4%E7%94%BA&oldid=111188464"},{"id":"17386:national:fe71f243071f","cityId":"17386","category":"地域","text":"宝達志水町は、石川県の中部にある町です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%AE%9D%E9%81%94%E5%BF%97%E6%B0%B4%E7%94%BA&oldid=111188464"},{"id":"17386:national:34d6399a0aab","cityId":"17386","category":"地域","text":"町内には能登地方の最高峰である宝達山（標高637メートル）を有する。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%AE%9D%E9%81%94%E5%BF%97%E6%B0%B4%E7%94%BA&oldid=111188464"}],"17407":[{"id":"17407:national:9dbbc338090a","cityId":"17407","category":"文化・名所","text":"「雨の宮古墳群」は国指定の史跡です。","source":"https://kunishitei.bunka.go.jp/heritage/detail/401/1015"},{"id":"17407:national:87b523319a0c","cityId":"17407","category":"地域","text":"中能登町は、石川県鹿島郡にある町です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E4%B8%AD%E8%83%BD%E7%99%BB%E7%94%BA&oldid=109449900"}],"17461":[{"id":"17461:national:27ae8b3e52fc","cityId":"17461","category":"地理・自然","text":"町の北部、西部は丘陵地で南部は七尾北湾、東部は富山湾に面する。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E7%A9%B4%E6%B0%B4%E7%94%BA&oldid=109736105"},{"id":"17461:national:d8c8d91c759c","cityId":"17461","category":"地域","text":"穴水町は、石川県の能登半島中央に位置する町で、鳳珠郡に属しています。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E7%A9%B4%E6%B0%B4%E7%94%BA&oldid=109736105"}],"17463":[{"id":"17463:national:9dbbc338090a","cityId":"17463","category":"文化・名所","text":"「雨の宮古墳群」は国指定の史跡です。","source":"https://kunishitei.bunka.go.jp/heritage/detail/401/1015"},{"id":"17463:national:f7abf9f27235","cityId":"17463","category":"地理・自然","text":"能登町には鉢伏山があります。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E8%83%BD%E7%99%BB%E7%94%BA&oldid=110875152"},{"id":"17463:national:18d28caca933","cityId":"17463","category":"地理・自然","text":"能登町には町野川が流れています。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E8%83%BD%E7%99%BB%E7%94%BA&oldid=110875152"},{"id":"17463:national:e469143a0a5e","cityId":"17463","category":"地域","text":"能登町は、石川県の能登半島（能登地方）北部に位置する鳳珠郡の町です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E8%83%BD%E7%99%BB%E7%94%BA&oldid=110875152"}]}}
